# What the test image does not need.
#
# `test/run.sh` builds with the repository root as its context and the Dockerfile
# copies the whole context to /repo. Two directories dominate that:
#
#   src/   ~125 MB of other repositories' trees at pinned commits (git subrepo)
#   .git/  the whole history
#
# Neither is used by any suite: the installer tests read scripts/, pi/, herdr/,
# skills/ and home/, and no suite runs a git command. Leaving them in turns a
# small build into a 200 MB transfer to the daemon on every `test/run.sh`.
.git
src
node_modules
